        "Topic": "N\u1EA5u \u0103n",
        "SourceType": "original-20261114",
        "PreviewText": "Nh\u1EADt k\u00FD ghi l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n n\u1EA5u \u0103n ch\u01B0a ho\u00E0n h\u1EA3o nh\u01B0ng \u0111\u00E1ng nh\u1EDB.",
        "IsPublished": true
      },
      "references": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.cooking-soup.1990e370bdec41d88afabc580fd19055",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "VietnameseText": "Em trai t\u00F4i \u0103n h\u1EBFt m\u1ED9t b\u00E1t v\u00E0 xin th\u00EAm.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "My younger brother finished a bowl and asked for more.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
